  },
  "ingredients": [
    "3/4 ounce pork rinds",
    "1 tablespoon almond flour",
    "1 large egg (whisked)",
    "2 tablespoon low-carb maple syrup",
    "1 tablespoon heavy whipping cream",
    "1/4 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 ounce ground hot italian sausage",
    "1 ounce cheddar cheese (sliced)",
    "1 large egg"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out the sausage and set aside. Silicone rings work great for creating uniform patties.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pancake-sandwich/#wprm-recipe-51563-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_6982.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Powder the pork rinds in a food processor.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pancake-sandwich/#wprm-recipe-51563-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_6987.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a pan on the stove over medium-high heat. Add the sausage to the ring mold and cook until medium-well. Once cooked, wrap in foil and set aside to rest.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pancake-sandwich/#wprm-recipe-51563-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_6990.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the sausage is cooking, combine the pork rinds with the remaining bun ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pancake-sandwich/#wprm-recipe-51563-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_6999.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place another ring mold inside the pan and fill it three-quarters of the way full with batter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pancake-sandwich/#wprm-recipe-51563-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_7003.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once browned on the bottom, remove the ring mold and flip to the other side. Cook until browned. Repeat with the remaining batter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pancake-sandwich/#wprm-recipe-51563-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_7009.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the same pan, add an egg to the ring mold and lightly scramble it. Cook until completely solidified.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pancake-sandwich/#wprm-recipe-51563-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/img_7013.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Assemble the sandwich by placing the sausage patty, cheese, and egg between the bun halves. Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-pancake-sandwich/#wprm-recipe-51563-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
