    "video": {
      "name": "Keto Recipe - Low Carb Pancake Sandwich",
      "description": "I really wanted to share with everyone a recipe from my cookbook. It’s one of the fan-favorites when it comes to breakfasts, for both my readers and my own family. If you loved McDonald’s McGriddle Sandwich before you went keto, you’ll find this is an amazing low-carb copy cat!\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n\nThe Pancake Bun\n0.75 ounces pork rinds\n1 tablespoon almond flour\n1 large egg, beaten\n1 tablespoon heavy cream\n¼ teaspoon vanilla extract\n2 tablespoons maple syrup (recipe here)\n\nThe Filling\n2 ounces hot sausage\n1 slice cheddar cheese\n1 large egg\n\nNutrition Summary:\nEach sandwich comes out to be 698 Calories, 54.95g Fats, 3.09g Net Carbs, and 41.91g Protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 30 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
